<title>LEBANON: Lebanon bank assets rise 1.76 pct in April.</title>
<headline>Lebanon bank assets rise 1.76 pct in April.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total assets of Lebanon's banks rose 1.76 percent in April, the Lebanese Banks Association reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The association issued the following banking sector details (in billions of Lebanese pounds, unless otherwise stated):</p>
<p>		    Jan 97   Feb 97   Mar 97   Apr 97</p>
<p>Total Assets    37,326   37,394   38,237   38,911</p>
<p>Month change (%)  0.39    0.18     2.25     1.76</p>
<p>Deposits of Residents and Non-residents</p>
<p>		    30,883   31,290   31,916   32,553</p>
<p>Month change (%)  0.65    1.32     2.00     2.00</p>
<p>Claims on Residents and Non-residents</p>
<p>		    13,398   13,262   13,452   13,661</p>
<p>Month change (%)  0.82    1.02     1.43     1.55</p>
<p>Total capital    1,970    1,999    2,050    2,127</p>
<p>Month change (%)  1.37    1.49     2.54     3.74</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (961 1) 602057 745308 MG</p>
</text>
